From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ricardo Pardini <ricardo@pardini.net>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 22:43:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] DVDVideoCodecDRMPRIME: Detile MediaTek 10-bit frames
 into P010 DMA buffers

Instead of falling back to software decoding, copy MediaTek 10-bit
(MT2110) frames through the hwcontext transfer, which detiles them, into
a P010 DMA buffer from the software buffer pool. The GLES renderer
imports P010 directly. Software decoding stays as the fallback when the
transfer is not available.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 .../DVDCodecs/Video/DVDVideoCodecDRMPRIME.cpp | 58 ++++++++++++++++++-
 .../DVDCodecs/Video/DVDVideoCodecDRMPRIME.h   |  1 +
 2 files changed, 57 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDCodecs/Video/DVDVideoCodecDRMPRIME.cpp b/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDCodecs/Video/DVDVideoCodecDRMPRIME.cpp
index 790dd40f02..0fa960a62c 100644
